]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெயலா","parts":[{"text":"பெயலா","lemma":"பெயலா","gloss":"raining"}],"gloss":"raining","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னாதே","parts":[{"text":"னாதே","lemma":"னாதே","gloss":"does not cease"}],"gloss":"does not cease","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வானம்","parts":[{"text":"வானம்","lemma":"vāṉam","gloss":"sky/cloud"}],"gloss":"the sky"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதலர்","lemma":"kātalar","gloss":"lover"}],"gloss":"the lover"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நனிசேய்","parts":[{"text":"நனி","lemma":"naṉi","gloss":"very"},{"text":"சேய்","lemma":"cēy","gloss":"distant"}],"gloss":"very distant"},{"surface":"நாட்டர்","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டர்","lemma":"நாட்டர்","gloss":"he of the country"}],"gloss":"he of the country","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நம்முன்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"nam","gloss":"our/us"},{"text":"முன்","lemma":"muṉ","gloss":"before/in front of"}],"gloss":"before us"},{"surface":"னலரே","parts":[{"text":"னலரே","lemma":"னலரே","gloss":"he is not"}],"gloss":"he is not","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாங்குச்செய்","parts":[{"text":"யாங்கு","lemma":"yāṅku","gloss":"how"},{"text":"செய்","lemma":"cey","gloss":"do"}],"gloss":"how to do"},{"surface":"வாங்கொல்","parts":[{"text":"வாம்","lemma":"vām","gloss":"we will"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"particle of distress"}],"gloss":"will we, alas"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"யீங்கைய","parts":[{"text":"யீங்கைய","lemma":"யீங்கைய","gloss":"of the mimosa bush"}],"gloss":"of the mimosa bush","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வண்ணத்","parts":[{"text":"வண்ணத்","lemma":"வண்ணத்","gloss":"colorful"}],"gloss":"colorful","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துய்ம்மலர்","parts":[{"text":"துய்ம்மலர்","lemma":"துய்ம்மலர்","gloss":"soft-tufted flowers"}],"gloss":"soft-tufted flowers","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உதிர","parts":[{"text":"உதிர","lemma":"utir","gloss":"to fall/shed"}],"gloss":"to fall"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முன்னர்த்","parts":[{"text":"முன்னர்த்","lemma":"முன்னர்த்","gloss":"before us"}],"gloss":"before us","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்றும்","lemma":"tōṉṟu","gloss":"appearing"}],"gloss":"appearing"},{"surface":"பனிக்கடு","parts":[{"text":"பனி","lemma":"paṉi","gloss":"dew/cold"},{"text":"கடு","lemma":"kaṭu","gloss":"severe"}],"gloss":"harsh cold"},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"days"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the days"}]}],"literal":"The sky's area being covered, spreading, like the kings' / victory-beaten drums, thundering very many times, / the rain does not cease from the sky; the lover / is of a very distant land, and is not before us; / what shall we do, O friend, as the mimosa's / colorful, soft-tufted flowers shed, / and the harsh cold days appear before us?","translation":"Spreading so as to cover the face of the sky, thundering many times like the victory-beaten drums of kings, the clouds do not cease to rain. Our lover is in a very distant land, not here with us. What shall we do, my friend? The harsh, cold days of early winter are appearing before us, making the colorful, soft-tufted flowers of the mimosa bush fall.","modern":"வானம் முழுவதும் மறையும்படிப் பரவி, வெற்றி முரசு கொட்டும் அரசர்களின் முழக்கம் போலப் பலமுறை இடித்து, மேகம் மழையைப் பொழிவதை நிறுத்தவில்லை. நம் காதலர் மிகத் தொலைதூர நாட்டில் இருக்கிறார்; நம்முடன் இல்லை. தோழியே! ஈங்கை மரத்தின் அழகிய மென்மையான பூக்கள் உதிரும்படி, கடுமையான பனிக்காலம் நம் முன்னே வந்துவிட்டதே, நாம் இனி என்ன செய்வோம்?","explanation":"In this Pālai poem, the companion speaks to the heroine, expressing her deep concern over the onset of the cold season while the hero is away. The sky is covered with dark clouds that thunder incessantly like the victory drums of kings, and the rain does not stop. Meanwhile, the hero remains in a very distant land, far from them. The companion points out that the harsh, cold days of early winter are arriving, causing the delicate, colorful, cotton-like flowers of the īṅkai (mimosa) bush to fall. This shedding of flowers serves as a poignant metaphor for the heroine's fading beauty and physical decline due to the pain of separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,2.2],[2.2,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.66],[3.66,4.12],[4.12,4.48],[4.62,4.85],[4.85,5.2],[5.2,6.0],[6.8,7.2],[7.2,7.74],[7.74,8.29],[8.29,8.5],[8.5,9.4],[9.4,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,10.67],[10.67,11.24],[11.24,12.1],[12.1,12.5],[12.5,13.5],[13.5,13.8],[13.8,14.3],[14.3,14.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.0],[2.0,3.4],[3.4,3.9],[3.9,4.26],[4.26,4.7],[4.7,4.92],[4.92,5.31],[5.31,5.9],[5.9,6.8],[6.8,7.4],[7.4,8.6],[8.6,9.8],[9.8,10.4],[10.4,11.03],[11.03,11.45],[11.45,11.66],[11.66,12.08],[12.08,12.5],[12.5,13.3],[13.3,13.7],[13.7,14.4],[14.4,14.7],[14.7,15.2],[15.2,15.4]]},"sync":[[["விசும்புகண்","the area of the sky"]],[["புதையப்","to be hidden"]],[["பாஅய்","having spread"]],[["வேந்தர்","kings"]],[["வென்றெறி","beaten in victory"]],[["முரசின்","like the drum"]],[["நன்பல","very many"]],[["முழங்கிப்","having thundered"]],[["பெயலா","raining"]],[["னாதே","does not cease"]],[["வானம்","the sky"]],[["காதலர்","the lover"]],[["நனிசேய்","very distant"]],[["நாட்டர்","he of the country"]],[["நம்முன்","before us"]],[["னலரே","he is not"]],[["யாங்குச்செய்","how to do"]],[["வாங்கொல்","will we, alas"]],[["தோழி","O friend"]],[["யீங்கைய","of the mimosa bush"]],[["வண்ணத்","colorful"]],[["துய்ம்மலர்","soft-tufted flowers"]],[["உதிர","to fall"]],[["முன்னர்த்","before us"]],[["தோன்றும்","appearing"]],[["பனிக்கடு","harsh cold"]],[["நாளே","the days"]]]}